<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Yaqobeppe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaqobeppe</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Xoossa Goda Yesusi Kiristossa oothancha gidida Yaqobeppe biitta bolla laletida tammane nam77u kochatas sarotethi intes gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Metonne paace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte bolla duma duma wayey gakkiiko hessa wursi ufaysan qoodite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gaasoykka inte amano paccetithi intes danda7a immizayssa inte ereetta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte danda7an mini eqanaysi intes issi miishshikka pacconta kumetha assine wothoy bayndayta gidana mala ootho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte garssafe oonasikka eratethi pacciko oonakka kadhontta ba kiiyatethara wurisos immiza Xoossa wosso; izadeskka imettana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin sidhey baynda amanon wosso. Gaasoykka sidhiiza uray abba qathiza bullahe cariko malakko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessadey Godape aykokk demana giidi issinokka qoppofo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>He uray nam77u qohaaththaan ooyketidi ba bizza oge bolla hene haane giza asa malakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kase ziiqan diza ura Xoossi dhoqqu histiza gish ufa7etto. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Asa haroy maata cisha mala qoqofettiza gish dure ura Xoossi ziq histikko ufa7etto. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Away xugidi maata shullisees; maata ciishayka shullees; iza loo7etethikka dhayees; hessathokka durey hachchi hachchi dabursan diishin iza duretethi dhayees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Paccen miinni eqidadey izi anjjetidade. Gaasoyka izi paccera eqitishin Xoossi bena dosizaytas immida ufaysa deyo zawude izi ekkana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Oonikka paccetiza gidikko tana Xoossi paccees goppo, gaasoykka Xoossi ase iittan paccena, izi oonakka pacci erena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Gido attin issi issi uray paccetizay berika ba iitta amo kalishene baletishekko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Amoy qanthetetidape guye nagara yellees. Nagaraykka dicciidape guye hayqo yellees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta siiqo ishato inte ballettopite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Loo7o imotethine kumetha anjjoy wuri bolla Salo poo7ota Aawape wodhetes. Iza achan gede ha yuyiza kuwayka (eshoykka) dena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nu iza medhetethas koyro bayrata gidana mala ba sheninne ba tuma qaalan nuna yellides.</para>
  <para style="s">Siyidayssa ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Dosetida ta ishato hayssa yuushi qoppite. Asi wurikka siyanas esoto, hasa7asinne hanqqos esotopo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Asa hanqqoy Xoossa xiiloteth oothena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gish tunatethinne dalggida iittatethi intefe kessi yegidi inte shemppo ashanaas danda7iza inte gidon toketida qaala ashketethara ekkite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qaalay gizayssa oothite; attin mela siisi xalala siyzadista gididi interkka intena balethofite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Qaala siyishe siyida qaalay gizayssa oothontadey ba ayfeso mastotera xelliza asa malakko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bena xeelli beydi bees; izi ay milatizakone heraka baletti gides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gido attin bena geshiza loo7o woga xeelli beydi izan minizadey ba siydayssa oothizadeynne balonttadey izi ba oothon anjjetidade gidana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Be duuna nagontta berikka ba wozina baleththishe ta ammanayss gizadey berikka bena baleththees. Iza ammanoykka mella hada ammanokko. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Xoossa Aawa sinthan iittatethi baynda loo7o ammanoy; “Aayanne Aaway hayqqida nayta, istta azinati hayqqida maccashata metotetishin maadonne hayssa alameza tunatethafe bena nagokko.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ogey baynda maado koshshena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte bonchettida Goda Yesussa Kiristosa ammanizayta gidida mala asse besontta ogera maadofiite. <verse number="2-3" style="v"/>Worqqa yiich biradhen aaththdi loo7o mayo mayida asi inte shiqqizaso yiikko hessathokka qiita mayo mayidadey he shiqqizaso yiko qaseka hara qiita mayo mayda manqqo uray gelliko loo7o maydaysa duma boncho bonchidi “nees besiiza loo7o utizaso hessa beya” giidi hayinko manqqoza qasse “Ne hen hessan eqa, woykko haa ya ta garisan hugen uta” inte gikko; <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte inte garsan besontta maado oothista gideketi? Qasseka inte iitta qofan ooykittida iitta pirda piirdizayta gideketi? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta siiqo ishato ane siyte; isti ammanon durista gidana mala Xoossi bena dosizaytas ufayssan isttas immida kawotetha istti laattana mala hayssa ha alamezan diza manqota dooribeynee? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte qase manqota kawusheista. Intena waysiza durista gidetene? Intena piirdeso gochizay istta gidetenee? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Intenan xeygetida boncho Xoossa sunththa zigirizayti ista gidetenee? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Maxaafan “Ne lagge ne hu7e mala siiqa” geeteti xaafettida kawo woga inte polikko loo7o oothista. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte besonta maado madikko nagara oothista. woga sinthanka inte woga yedhidade gidi qodistana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gaasoykka woga wursi pollizadey qasekka wogape issineyin dhuphetiza uray wursikka moridade mala qoodettees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Laymatopa” gidadey izikka zaaridi “wodhopa” gides. Ne laymatontta agikokka ne asa wodhikko wogape adhiidade gidaassa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Inte hasa7a hasa7ishe woykko issi miishshi oothishe intena xiillisiza asa mala gidite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gaasoykka marontay wurikka maroy baynda pirdistana. Maroy pirda Xoonees.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammanonne ootho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta ishato issi uray taas ammanoy dees gikko qasse oothon besontade gidikko iza ay maadanee? Hesamala amanoy iza ashane? <verse number="15-16" style="v"/>Ane qoppite, issi ishay woykko issi michiya mayoy woykko mizayssi baynda aggiko intefe isadey “Inte saron biite, intena megopo, kallite” giiko istta ashos koshizayssa immontta aggikko ay maadanee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hesathokka oothoy baynda ammanoykka bees hayidayssa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gido attin isadey “Taas oothoy dees nees ammanoy dees. Neni ne ammano oothope shaakada tana bessa, ta qasse ta ammano oothon nena bessana gikko; <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ne “issi Xoossi dizaysa ammanayss” loo7oko; daydanthatikka hessa mala ammanettesinne kehi kokoreetes. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neno eeyazo! oothoy baynda ammanos go7ay bayndayssa eranas marikka koyazii? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nu Aawa Abramey ba na Yisaqa yarshizasoza bolla shiishshida wode oothon xilli beynee? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessan ammanoy iza oothora isife dizaysanne amanoy ooothon poletidayssa beyazii? <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Abramey Xoossu ammanides; He amanoy izas xiillotethan qoodetides” giza maxaafa qaalay poletides; izikka Xoossi dosidade geetettides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gish asi ammanon xalala gidontta oothonkka xiillizaysa inte beyeista. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hesathokka laymman diza Era7aba kiiteti bida asata mokka ekada hara ogera moyza yedida gish ba oothon xiillabeykee? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shemppofe shaakettida ashoy hayqeeth gidida mala oothopekka shaakettida ammanoy hayqethikko.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Be duuna nago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato intefe daroti astamarista gidopeto, gaasoykka nu astamare gididayti aadhetha pirda ekanaysa inte ereista. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nu wurikka daro miishan dhuphetoos. Hasa7an dhuphetontadey dikko izi ba asateth loo7athi naganaas danda7iza kumetha asakko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuni parazota azazanaas bixxala barsidi nu koyda mala istta azazoos. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Woykko ane markabista xeelite. Ay gitatanne carikon lagetizayta gidikokka marikabe lagiizadey qeeri laafa laagiza misheyira ba koyizaso efees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessathokka asatetha garisan inxxarisi guuthu gida utada giita wollqama oothoro oothoristaysu, qeeri tamay gita wora wostti xuuggi dhaysiizakonne ane yuushi qoppiite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inxxarasikka ba bagara tama malakko. Nu asatetha gidon diza iitta alamekko. Asatetha wursa tuniisaysunne asatetha bolla tama gujawusu, besiika gaaname taman xugistana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mehey do7ayka kafoti hayssathokka biita bolla gochetizaytinne abba gidon diza medhetethata wursi asi harana danda7esinne istikka haraettida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin inxxars haranaas danda7ida uray oonikka dena. Wodhiiza maridzdzey izin kumidaronne iza shemppa ekontta iitta mishshikko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuni nu inxxarasayra Godanne Aawa anjjoos. Izinkka Xoossa lemison medhetida asa nayta zaaridi qangoos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Anjjoynne qangethi issi duunara keezes. Ta ishato hessi hessaththo hananaas bessena. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Issi pullto ollafe mal7o haththinne camo haththi pullti erizee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta ishato Balase geetettiza miiththi woyra ayfe woykko woyine miiththi Balase miiththa ayfe ayfanaas danda7ize? Hesathokka camiza hathefe mall7iza haththi bistana danda7ena.</para>
  <para style="s">Nam77u qomo erateth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte garathafe akekara diza ciincca uray oone? cinccay diza gidiko ane ba ootho ashketethan cinccatethara ba loo7o dussan besso. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qasse camonne qaanatey intena xalala dosiza hanoy inte wozinan diza giikko ootoroteth intes siyetofo. Tumaka kadopiite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiini mala eratethiya salloppe gidiku. Hina qasse biittafe; ashopene xala7eppekko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>qanateyinne berika bena siqqoy dizason wasoynne iitta oothoy wuri dees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sallope gidida eratethiya gidikko koyro geshshikko, guyepekka saroteth dosizaro, danda7izaaro, ero gizaro, marotethinne loo7o ayfey kumidarokko. Qasse worodo madontaronne ulon geney bayndaro. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Saroteth dosiza asati sarotethan zeridi xillotetha ayfe maxeettes.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Intenatetha Xoossas harasiite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inte garsan diza oolaynne ooshay awape yidee? Inte wozinan diza amotethafe dendida oola gidenee? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte amottista shin demekista. Inte asi wodhistanne kehi amotista shin demana danda7ekista. Inte inte garisan ooyetiza gishanne ooletiza gish qasse wosontta gish intes imettena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte inte asho ufaysanaas iitta qofan wosiza gish wosidaysa inte ekekista. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inteno laymatizayto alamera siiqetethi Xoossara morketeth gididaysa ereketii? Hessa gish hayssa alamezara siiqitethi koyzay wurikka Xoossas morke. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Woykko gesha maxaafa gidon “nunan izi ayssiida ayanay nu ziaysa gidana mala daro amottees” gizaysi intes coo mela gidayssa milatize? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin izi ba kiiyateth nuus gujji immees. Maxafaykka “Xoossi ootoranchatara eqettees, ashikistas qase ba kiiyateth immees” giday hessasikko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish intena Xoossas harisiite. Dabuloosara eqitite, izi intefe baqatana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossako shiiqqite izikka intekko shiiqqana. Inteno nagaranchato! inte inte kushe geeshshite, inte nam77u qofan qaxiizayto, inte inte wozina geeshshite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Darsi qoppite; muyagiite; yekiite. Inte michay yehon; ufaysay qasse qadhetethan siimo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Goda sinththan inte intena kawushite qasse izi intena dhooqu dhooqu histtana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte inte garisan issay issay motoopite ba isha motizadeynne ba isha bolla piridizadey woga bolla iitta hasa7esinne woga bolla piridees. Ne woga bolla pirdizade attin woga naagizade gidakka. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Woga wothidadeynne pirdizadey issade xalalakko. Izikka dhaysanaasinne ashanaas danda7izadekko. Gido attin neni ne lagge bolla pirdizadey oone?</para>
  <para style="s">Ceqistanaas bessena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte hachchchi woykko wontto hano ha katamayo woykko hiino he katamayo nu baana, biidi hen izin issi laythth utananne zal77i wodhisana gizayto ane haa siyte. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wonto hananayssa inte erekista. Inte shemppoy iza azee? Inteni guutha wode ayfes bettidi dhayiza haththa penta malakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hassa gaanappe “Goda shene gidikonne nu paxxa dikko, hessakka hayssaka oothana” gaanas intes bessees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha7i gidiko inte otoretethan ceqetista. Hessa mala oothoretethi wurikka iitta. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gish loo7o gidizayssa oothanas besizaysa erishe oothonttades nagara gidana.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Duristas imettida zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Histikko inteno dure asato, ane siiyte. Buro inte bolla gakkana metoza gish yekiite, wu! wu! gi wasiite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte haaroy buqqides, inte mayoykka bil7ay/baday/ mides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte worqayinne inte biiray shiyides. He shiydaysikka inte bolla marikatesinne inte ashoy tama mala xuugees. Inte wode wurisethas miishshe shiishshidista. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inte inte wozinan wothite inte kaththi maxishe pe7idaytas istta wollqa waaga inte qanxxontta aggida gish inte bolla wasishe inte achchan deettes. Kaththi maxizayta wassoy wursi danda7iza Goda haythan gakides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Inte biitta bolla ishallonne aloo7etethan deyidista, inte wozina shuka galasas dhiikki handadhathidista. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte intenara eqetontta xiillo asata bolla worido wothidi wodhiidista.</para>
  <para style="s">Meto danda7o.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta ishato Goday ha yaana gakanas danda7ite. Goshshe goyizadey biittay loo7o kathth kaxxana gakanaas wani danda7izakone balgo/asura/ irane ofintha ira izi wostti naagizako ane akekkite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inteka hessaththo danda7ite. Inte wozina miinthite. Gaasoykka Goda yussa gallas matides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte inte garsan zigretopite, inte zigretiko inte bolla piridistana. Piridanadey heko inte penge bolla eqqides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ta ishato Goda sunththan intes yootida nabeta wayetethinne istta danda7a intes lemuso histti xeellite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Danda7an genccida asata nu istta “IstTi anjjetidayta” gi qoodizayssa inte ereista. Iyobey wanii danda7idakonne inte iza gish siyidista. Goday iza wurisethan ay oothidakone inte beyidista. Goday asas keehi michetizadenne marizadekko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Harapeka ta ishato sallon gidin woykko biitta bolla gidin woykko ay mishanka caqqofite; “Ee” gaanas bessiza miishsha gidikko “Ee” giite; “Akaye” gaanas gidiko “Akaye” giite hessafe hara giiko inte bolla pirdistana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammano wossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte garisan metotiza uray dizee? Diza gidiko izi wosso. Ufa7etizadey dizee? diza gidiko ufayssa yeethi yeexxo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte gidon saketiza assi dizee? diiko wossa keeththa ciimata xeyigo. Isttikka Goda sunththan zayte iza bolla tiyidi izas wosseto. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ammanon wossida wossay hargidade pathana. Godaykka iza denthana. Izi nagara oothidade gidikokka Xoossi iza maarana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gish intekka inte garisan issay issara inte nagara paxxetite; paxana mala issay issas wossite. Xiillo asa wossay wolliqara dees. Wollqama oothokka ooththees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Elasay nu malaka asekko. Izi iray bukontta mala minthi wossin biitta bolla hezdzdu laythanne bagga gakanaas iray bukiibeyna. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qasseka zaari wossin iray sallope biitta bolla bukides. Biittayka kaath immides. <verse number="19-20" style="v"/>Ta ishato intefe issadey tumape baletin hara uray iza zaariko hessa wozinan wothiite. Nagarancha izi balletida ogepe iza zaaridadey he uray shempo hayqope ashesinne izaade nagara darozaka kammees.</para>
</usx>
